\contentsline {added}{Added: \truncate {\Changestruncatewidth }{ help brainstorm possible angles for narrowing my topic, to assist me in identifying key themes in readings, and to offer alternative titles and revision suggestions (e.g., improving clarity and structure)}}{5}{section*.35}%
\contentsline {deleted}{Deleted: \truncate {\Changestruncatewidth }{[Your reflection]}}{5}{section*.36}%
\contentsline {added}{Added: \truncate {\Changestruncatewidth }{I learned to be cautious about over-relying on AI, not treating its outputs as authoritative. Any literature summaries were checked against the original sources, and I verified wording, concepts, and citations myself. I also revised the AI-generated suggestions substantially to match my own argument, evidence, and writing style. I am aware that generative AI can produce incomplete or inaccurate information, so I used it only to support idea development and editing, not to replace my own reading, analysis, or responsibility for the final content.}}{5}{section*.37}%
